<SiteLayout title="Part Of The Community | Growing Kids" description="Explore Growing Kids involvement in local events and organizations supporting children and families across Northern Indiana." breadcrumbs={[{name:"Part Of The Community",path:"/community-involvement/"}]}><section class="page-hero"><div class="wrap"><h1>Part Of The Community</h1><p class="intro">Growing Kids supports local events and organizations that serve Northern Indiana children and families. Our community involvement includes food support, youth activities and events that bring neighbors together.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button primary" href="/book-a-tour/">Schedule a Tour</a></div></div></section>
<section class="section sage"><div class="wrap split"><h2>Care reaches beyond our classrooms.</h2><div><p>Growing Kids’ published community work includes support for Cultivate Food Rescue, Feed the Children and the Food Bank of Northern Indiana.</p><p>Other initiatives have included WNDU Pack-a-Backpack, Operation Snow Pants, the Ronald McDonald House Family Room of Michiana and United Way.</p></div></div></section><section class="section"><div class="wrap split"><div><h2>Room to play. Reasons to gather.</h2><p>Youth sports and local events connect families outside the school day. Growing Kids has supported Valparaiso Parks youth soccer and T-ball, Concord Little League, Logan’s Run and Downtown Goshen First Fridays.</p><p>Community events such as the Valparaiso Popcorn Festival give families another place to meet and have fun together.</p></div><div><h2>See the stories.</h2><p>Explore published news and school events, or get to know the people behind Growing Kids.</p><p><a href="/company-news-events/">News and events</a> · <a href="/team/">Our team</a> · <a href="/locations/">Our centers</a></p></div></div></section>
</SiteLayout>